.TH dalgona-dev-help-journal 1  "dalgona-dev-help-journal " 
.SH NAME
dalgona\-dev\-help\-journal \- Replay, diff, and edit session journals.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgona dev help journal\fR [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replay, diff, and edit session journals.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-help\-journal\-replay(1)
Fold a journal and print the recovered state.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-help\-journal\-diff(1)
Print the folded fields that differ between two journals.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-help\-journal\-torn(1)
Copy a journal with its tail cut mid\-record.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-help\-journal\-sidecar(1)
List or dump the sidecar files in a session directory.
